  "bodyHash": "KzEeSS6bVNE=",
  "content": "<h1>独特暗黑</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth上的独特暗黑\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge上的独特暗黑\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon上的AmongstReality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee上的AmongstReality\"></a></p><p>该资源包为游戏中每个功能性方块提供了独特的纹理。部分纹理需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能生效。</p><p>独特暗黑支持众多模组，并且几乎每次更新都会增加更多支持。</p><h2>独特暗黑 - Lite版 vs 完整版</h2><p><strong>独特暗黑 - Lite版</strong> 是可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下载的版本。</p><p><strong>独特暗黑 - 完整版</strong> 是可在我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 下载的版本。</p><blockquote>\n  <p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong> 该资源包仅在上文提到的平台提供下载，并在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 有独立页面。如果您在其他平台找到它——<strong>请勿下载</strong>，因为这些平台未经授权且非官方地重新分发。下载链接可能导向恶意网站，下载内容可能包含病毒。</p>\n</blockquote><p>以下列表显示了Lite版和完整版中包含的纹理，以及哪些需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能生效。未包含在Lite版中的纹理也已重新绘制，以适配资源包的艺术风格。</p><h3>✅ Lite版包含：</h3><ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔炉</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>铜箱子</li>\n<li>默认潜影盒</li>\n<li>铁砧</li>\n<li>铁砧变种</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民职业变种</li>\n<li>可骑乘变种</li>\n<li>羊驼变种</li>\n</ul><h3>✅ 完整版额外包含（在Lite版基础上增加）：</h3><ul>\n<li>高炉</li>\n<li>烟熏炉</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>铜箱子变种</li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>切石机</li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>制图台</li>\n<li>锻造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>发射器</li>\n<li>投掷器</li>\n<li>合成器</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul><h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3><ul>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>铜箱子</li>\n<li>铜箱子变种</li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>铁砧变种</li>\n<li>发射器</li>\n<li>投掷器</li>\n<li>村民职业变种</li>\n<li>可骑乘变种</li>\n<li>羊驼变种</li>\n</ul><h2>在此支持我和我的项目：</h2><p>您可以通过加入 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 的紫水晶等级会员或在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 上支持，获取独特暗黑的完整版。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p><h2>模组支持（目前支持79个模组）</h2><p>您可以在此 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提出对模组的支持请求</a>，我可能会在未来添加。当前支持的模组如下：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faccessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品 (Accessories)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancedae\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级AE (AdvancedAE)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae2-import-export-card\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE2 输入输出卡 (AE2 Import Export Card)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex的洞穴 (Alex's Caves)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化 (Apotheosis)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化属性 (Apothic Attributes)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化附魔 (Apothic Enchanting)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神化刷怪笼 (Apothic Spawners)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">苹果皮 (AppleSkin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2-wireless-terminals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用能源2无线终端 (Applied Energistics 2 Wireless Terminals)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用能源2 (Applied Energistics 2)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-flux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用通量 (Applied Flux)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appliede\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用E (AppliedE)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farmor-hud\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">护甲HUD (Armor Hud)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faxiom\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">公理 (Axiom)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/backpacked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">背包满溢 (Backpacked)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-furnaces-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的熔炉重铸 (Better Furnaces Reforged)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbrewin-and-chewin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">酿造与咀嚼 (Brewin' And Chewin')</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclientsort\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">客户端排序 (Client Sort)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">装饰性护甲重制 (Cosmetic Armor Reworked)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成调整 (Crafting Tweaks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力 (Create)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge 版)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易潜影盒 (Easy Shulker Boxes)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252femi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchancement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔增强 (Enchancements)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-infuser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">附魔灌注器 (Enchanting Infuser)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实体纹理特性 (Entity Texture Features)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">曝光 (Exposure)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-pattern-provider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">扩展AE (ExtendedAE)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-sound-muffler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">极限消音器 (Forge 版)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事 (Farmer's Delight)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火之歌：龙 (Ice and Fire: Dragons)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式飞机 [Fabric/Forge]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fin-game-account-switcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">游戏内账号切换器 (In-Game Account Switcher)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">殷密斯 (Inmis)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventorio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">库存增强 (Inventorio)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finventory-management\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">库存管理 (Inventory Management)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-profiles-next\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">库存配置下一版 (Inventory Profiles Next)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firon-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁箱子 (Iron Chests)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁熔炉 (Iron Furnaces)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fitemswapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品交换器 (ItemSwapper)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsaddon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">职业附加 (JobsAddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">完美升级 (Just Leveling)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/language-reload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">语言重载 (Language Reload)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">等级Z (LevelZ)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">库Z (LibZ)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/merequester\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ME请求器 (ME Requester)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-cells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MEGA存储单元 (MEGA Cells)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单 (Mod Menu)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecra