craft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易语音聊天 (Simple Voice Chat)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精致背包 (Sophisticated Backpacks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精致存储 (Sophisticated Storage)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">存储抽屉 (Storage Drawers)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">补充 (Supplementaries)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林 (The Twilight Forest)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftoms-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">汤姆的简易存储模组 (Tom's Simple Storage Mod)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashslot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">垃圾桶槽位 (TrashSlot)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旅者背包 (Traveler's Backpack)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品 (Fabric 版)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useful-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">实用背包 (Useful Backpacks)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnotebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版笔记本 (Vanilla Notebook)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石碑 (Waystones)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyy